<title>USA: U.S. livestock slaughter, meat production - USDA.</title>
<headline>U.S. livestock slaughter, meat production - USDA.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1996-09-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>USDA reported total commercial livestock slaughterings as follows: (1,000 head):</p>
<p>			CATTLE    CALVES    HOGS</p>
<p>	  Aug 96    3,209.8   157.8   7,674.8</p>
<p>	  Jul 96-R  3,147.9   160.4   7,337.9</p>
<p>	  Aug 95    3,236.9   124.5   8,264.7</p>
<p>	    --</p>
<p>	 1996	24,912.4 1,153.8    60,862.6</p>
<p>	 1995	23,651.5   921.7    63,208.1</p>
<p> Commercial meat production (million lbs):</p>
<p>		BEEF    VEAL    PORK</p>
<p>   Aug 96  2,260     32    1,394</p>
<p>   Jul 96  2,194     32    1,339</p>
<p>   Aug 95  2,316     26    1,504</p>
<p>---</p>
<p> 1996 --  17,397    242   11,225</p>
<p> 1995 --  16,619    202   11,683</p>
<p>USDA detailed livestock slaughtered under federal inspection for 48 states as follows:</p>
<p>		    Aug 96    Jul 96  Aug 95</p>
<p>CATTLE (1,000 head) --</p>
<p>	   Steers  1,558   1,567   1,698</p>
<p>	  Heifers    930     877     919</p>
<p>     Dairy Cows    254     241-R   238</p>
<p>     Other Cows    333     332-R   259</p>
<p>   Bulls, Stags     69	63	62</p>
<p>   Total	   3,143   3,080   3,176</p>
<p>R--Revised</p>
<p>HOGS (1,000 head) --</p>
<p>		     Aug 96   Jul 96   Aug 95</p>
<p> Barrows, Gilts   7,169    6,832   7,657</p>
<p>	     Sows     284	298     346</p>
<p>   Stags, Boars	57	 56	80</p>
<p>	    Total   7,509    7,187   8,083</p>
<p>Note - Totals may not add due to rounding.</p>
<p>Cumulative totals --</p>
<p>		    1996	   1995</p>
<p>CATTLE (1,000 head):</p>
<p>	 Steers  12,258	12,178</p>
<p>	Heifers   7,073	 6,687</p>
<p>   Dairy Cows   1,975	 1,865</p>
<p>   Other Cows   2,570	 1,999</p>
<p> Bulls, Stags     473	   447</p>
<p>	  Total  24,350	23,177</p>
